{
  "_about": "Glassware design tokens: the one place these numbers live. tools/frame.py, tools/check.py, tools/shot.js (the audit), tools/new_script.py (the kit's template), tools/prismcut.py and tools/banners.py read them; CLAUDE.md's tables must match them (tools/check.py compares). Change a number here, run python3 tools/frame.py and python3 tools/pages.py, recapture, ship.",
